@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<section class="page-intro about-intro">
    <div class="container intro-grid">
        <div><span class="kicker">Guest information</span><h1>A simple privacy note for this demonstration.</h1></div>
        <p>This academic demo stores the booking details needed to create a ticket and show the organizer guest list. Card payments are simulated.</p>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="section-wrap">
    <div class="container about-copy">
        <h2>What this demo records</h2>
        <p>Name, email, phone number, ticket category, quantity, booking source and a masked card display are stored for the event workflow. The full card number and CVV are not stored.</p>
        <p>For a production system, replace the demo payment flow with a certified payment provider and publish a legally reviewed privacy policy.</p>
    </div>
</section>
